\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   A word, which is wonderful,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Advice and encouragement
\par Honour and of  heart cooling
\par Of  his teachings and meekness
\par Unsearchable mystery
\par These are the true love of God
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  People who don't know themselves
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Those who've never met before
\par And without interaction
\par Both in mind and in one heart
\par These are those whom God converts
\par And He unite the righteous
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  He thus unites the righteous
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 He knows what is uprightness
\par And what is permissible
\par For which no man can restrain
\par And God's will is permanent
\par For the ways of man perish
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. See how Joyous His lovers
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Stay in Holy marriage
\par They receive His rich blessings
\par And they in their works prosper
\par They succeed in all they do
\par And it ends well with them too.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Their love turns anew always
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 And assume stronger measures
\par They sit at table in love
\par And they eat with one accord
\par This love unites them in one
\par And make them forget their woes
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Now peaceful life and honour
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Joy, and satisfaction
\par Goodness, progress and blessings
\par Come upon them all through love
\par Unsearchable misery,
\par This is what shows Gods true love
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

